  "tha-ap176:2.2": "kammamakariṁ → kamammakariṁ (bj)",
  "tha-ap176:3.3": "sāsanaṁ → sāsananti (sya-all)",
  "tha-ap176:4.1": "udapānadāyako → udadānadāyako (sya-all)",
  "tha-ap176:5.1": "udapānadāyakattherassāpadānaṁ → udapānadāyakattherassa apadānaṁ (bj)"
